    "text": "@[category research open, AMS 5 11]\ntheorem erdos_326 : answer(sorry) ↔ ∀ (A : Set ℕ), A.IsAddBasisOfOrder 2 →\n    ∃ (b : ℕ → ℕ), StrictMono b ∧ ∀ n, b n ∈ A ∧ (Set.range b).IsAddBasis ∧\n      ∀ (x : ℝ), ¬ Tendsto (fun n ↦ (b n : ℝ) / n ^ 2) atTop (𝓝 x)",
